{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0001", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "阳明病专论肠胃；太阳战败或发汗太过可传入，阳明为第二道防线，病至此无所复传。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.yangming"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c01", "evidence_quote": "所以说当你阳太没没好的的候进入阳明症，阳阳病不会传经就到此为止", "seg_from": 32, "seg_to": 43, "start_s": 191.55, "end_s": 259.605, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=191s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 191.55, "end_s": 259.61}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "阳太=太阳；阳阳=阳明", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0002", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "护胃气：平常吃七八分饱，病时五分饱，勿十分饱，使胃气自能运化。", "entity_ids": ["zangfu.wei"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c01", "evidence_quote": "平常吃七八分饱，不要吃十分饱", "seg_from": 62, "seg_to": 62, "start_s": 356.3, "end_s": 365.455, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=356s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 356.3, "end_s": 365.45}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0003", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "clause_interpretation", "statement": "第179条三阳明：太阳阳明多因发汗利小便成脾约；正阳阳明胃家实；少阳阳明发汗利小便胃中燥大便难。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.179", "syndrome.pi_yue"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c02", "evidence_quote": "这个太阳阳明者发汗皮曰是", "seg_from": 81, "seg_to": 91, "start_s": 462.51, "end_s": 535.13, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=462s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 462.51, "end_s": 535.13}, "confidence": 0.8, "asr_note": "皮曰=脾约", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0004", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "clause_interpretation", "statement": "第180条：阳明之为病，胃家实是也。胃家含胃、十二指肠、小肠、大肠。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.180", "six_channel.yangming"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c02", "evidence_quote": "就是胃中有讲的胃不单单是胃，阳明呢包含的胃、十二指肠、小肠、大肠都在内", "seg_from": 107, "seg_to": 110, "start_s": 592.1, "end_s": 616.225, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=592s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 592.1, "end_s": 616.23}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0005", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "pathomechanism", "statement": "转属阳明多因津液受伤：发汗过多或小便过多，胃中干燥而成燥实。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.yangming"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c03", "evidence_quote": "你发汗了以后，津液发了散太多，汗流太多，小便多多成胃中干燥", "seg_from": 150, "seg_to": 156, "start_s": 817.99, "end_s": 868.425, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=817s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 817.99, "end_s": 868.42}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0006", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "阳明居中土，万物所归，无所复传；虽初恶寒，二日自止。病到阳明即停。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.184", "six_channel.yangming"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c03", "evidence_quote": "杨明呢是居中图，也万物所归，无所复传", "seg_from": 180, "seg_to": 184, "start_s": 986.71, "end_s": 1031.01, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=986s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 986.71, "end_s": 1031.01}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "杨明=阳明；中图=中土", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0007", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "虽见腹满咽干似阳明，若兼表寒或未纯里实，不可攻下；先解表，再攻里。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.yangming", "formula.da_cheng_qi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c04", "evidence_quote": "你一定要看清楚，它是纯阳明", "seg_from": 289, "seg_to": 308, "start_s": 1638.397, "end_s": 1799.897, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=1638s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 1638.4, "end_s": 1799.9}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0008", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "阳明病若能食为中风（胃热在），不能食为中寒（胃冷）；攻下必确认为正阳明燥实。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.191"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c04", "evidence_quote": "阳明病，若能食名为中风，不能食名为中寒", "seg_from": 309, "seg_to": 310, "start_s": 1801.337, "end_s": 1827.817, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=1801s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 1801.34, "end_s": 1827.82}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0009", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "阳明潮热多在申酉（黄昏）时段；散步一阵热上即提示阳明热，当问大便。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.yangming"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c04", "evidence_quote": "就是每次黄昏的时候哈，在夕阳西下的时候", "seg_from": 381, "seg_to": 387, "start_s": 2236.287, "end_s": 2282.352, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=2236s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 2236.29, "end_s": 2282.35}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0010", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "阳明脉浮紧者必潮热，发于日晡黄昏；但浮者必盗汗。潮热如潮水阵阵。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.201", "six_channel.yangming"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c05", "evidence_quote": "脉浮紧者必潮热好发作，有时但浮者必知汗出", "seg_from": 509, "seg_to": 515, "start_s": 3019.187, "end_s": 3056.147, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=3019s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 3019.19, "end_s": 3056.15}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0011", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "虽有阳明便秘，表证未解须先解表再攻；否则表邪下陷可成结胸。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.yangming", "formula.da_cheng_qi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c05", "evidence_quote": "虽然人有阳明病好，就是有便秘要去攻他大便，要把表症先去掉", "seg_from": 553, "seg_to": 554, "start_s": 3270.207, "end_s": 3292.017, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=3270s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 3270.21, "end_s": 3292.02}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0012", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "clause_interpretation", "statement": "第207条：阳明病不吐不下心烦，调胃承气汤。病机在十二指肠段梗结。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.207", "formula.diao_wei_cheng_qi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c05", "evidence_quote": "不吐不下，心烦者可以调胃承气汤", "seg_from": 598, "seg_to": 610, "start_s": 3556.346, "end_s": 3628.091, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=3556s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 3556.35, "end_s": 3628.09}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0013", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "formula_composition", "statement": "调胃承气：酒洗大黄、炙甘草、芒硝。炙甘草缓大黄芒硝速度，使药力停于中焦十二指肠段；芒硝后下冲化，勿久煮。", "entity_ids": ["formula.diao_wei_cheng_qi_tang", "herb.da_huang", "herb.xiao_shi"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c05", "evidence_quote": "那个用炙甘草，然后用大黄，还有囊硝", "seg_from": 611, "seg_to": 619, "start_s": 3628.746, "end_s": 3677.716, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=3628s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 3628.75, "end_s": 3677.72}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "囊硝=芒硝", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0014", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "大黄甘草汤：食已即吐之实证（宿食）；虚证朝食暮吐另属吴茱萸等。", "entity_ids": ["formula.da_huang_gan_cao_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c06", "evidence_quote": "去上班回到家里面，晚上咦烧饼油条吐出来", "seg_from": 673, "seg_to": 678, "start_s": 3963.106, "end_s": 4002.966, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=3963s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 3963.11, "end_s": 4002.97}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0015", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "小承气：燥实堵在小肠，主症排气多；大承气：燥屎在大肠，气亦难通，粪如长鞭不断。", "entity_ids": ["formula.xiao_cheng_qi_tang", "formula.da_cheng_qi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c06", "evidence_quote": "小承气汤呢是解阳明的燥实，大便是堵在小肠里面", "seg_from": 700, "seg_to": 740, "start_s": 4107.226, "end_s": 4293.581, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=4107s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 4107.23, "end_s": 4293.58}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0016", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "herb_property", "statement": "芒硝不唯软坚燥屎，亦可攻坚积聚、肿瘤、脓疡、积水；宜后下，久煮则仅如盐无攻下力。", "entity_ids": ["herb.xiao_shi"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c06", "evidence_quote": "盲硝不单单是攻坚硬的大便，盲硝攻肿块积聚", "seg_from": 915, "seg_to": 923, "start_s": 5236.664, "end_s": 5293.324, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=5236s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 5236.66, "end_s": 5293.32}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "盲硝=芒硝", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0017", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "阳明经热→白虎（石膏）；腑实腐热→承气（大黄芒硝）。潮热壮热属白虎线索；小便浓黄、矢气多为承气。", "entity_ids": ["formula.bai_hu_tang", "formula.da_cheng_qi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c07", "evidence_quote": "所以阳明呢我们讲的就是白虎和陈气啊", "seg_from": 1005, "seg_to": 1010, "start_s": 5753.771, "end_s": 5782.65, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=5753s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 5753.77, "end_s": 5782.65}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "陈气=承气", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0018", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "若本当大承气而误用小承气，则大便不出唯频矢气——提示应改大承气。", "entity_ids": ["formula.da_cheng_qi_tang", "formula.xiao_cheng_qi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c08", "evidence_quote": "你开成小神器，小神器这下去大便没出来，一直在放屁", "seg_from": 1050, "seg_to": 1050, "start_s": 5975.651, "end_s": 5986.766, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=5975s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 5975.65, "end_s": 5986.77}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "小神器=小承气", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0019", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "大承气舌苔黑而干；极寒舌黑而润有津。前硬后溏示内有寒湿，勿妄投大承气。", "entity_ids": ["formula.da_cheng_qi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c08", "evidence_quote": "那大承气汤那个黑呢根本就干掉了，一看就干掉了", "seg_from": 1053, "seg_to": 1063, "start_s": 5997.041, "end_s": 6081.681, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=5997s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 5997.04, "end_s": 6081.68}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0020", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "treatment_principle", "statement": "大承气得下即止后服，勿尽剂；一通即停。", "entity_ids": ["formula.da_cheng_qi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c08", "evidence_quote": "大承气汤正呢，你大便一通出来可以停掉", "seg_from": 1156, "seg_to": 1156, "start_s": 6720.501, "end_s": 6728.806, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=6720s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 6720.5, "end_s": 6728.81}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0021", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "承气攻下后大便仍不出，不可再攻，脉虚为难治；再攻则更虚。", "entity_ids": ["formula.da_cheng_qi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c08", "evidence_quote": "以虚者为难治，不可再给他承气汤", "seg_from": 1203, "seg_to": 1214, "start_s": 6980.768, "end_s": 7047.303, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=6980s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 6980.77, "end_s": 7047.3}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0022", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "同有潮热谵语：不能食→大承气；能食→小承气。", "entity_ids": ["formula.da_cheng_qi_tang", "formula.xiao_cheng_qi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c08", "evidence_quote": "如果不能吃东西，大神器如果可以吃东西，就是只是大片小承气汤汤", "seg_from": 1220, "seg_to": 1226, "start_s": 7073.118, "end_s": 7117.563, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=7073s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 7073.12, "end_s": 7117.56}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "大神器=大承气", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0023", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "手足濈然汗出而阳明燥实已定→大承气；额上汗出手足濈然汗出而气喘→白虎。", "entity_ids": ["formula.da_cheng_qi_tang", "formula.bai_hu_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c09", "evidence_quote": "手脚汗出很多的时候，实症里面确定是阳明燥实造成的，手脚汗多，这个时候就开大承气汤", "seg_from": 1291, "seg_to": 1313, "start_s": 7500.448, "end_s": 7627.748, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=7500s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 7500.45, "end_s": 7627.75}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
