{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0025", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "formula_composition", "statement": "猪苓汤：猪苓泽泻茯苓阿胶滑石等量。五苓去桂术加阿胶滑石即成；主小便痛、结石、血淋。滑石攻坚，阿胶止血。", "entity_ids": ["formula.zhu_ling_tang", "formula.wu_ling_san"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c10", "evidence_quote": "把桂枝、白术拿掉，阿胶跟滑石就变成猪苓汤", "seg_from": 1352, "seg_to": 1366, "start_s": 7837.668, "end_s": 7931.503, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=7837s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 7837.67, "end_s": 7931.5}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0026", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "clause_interpretation", "statement": "第225条：脉浮而迟、表热里寒、下利清谷，四逆汤。胃中虚冷不能食、饮水则哕，亦属里寒。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.225", "formula.si_ni_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c10", "evidence_quote": "表热里寒，下令清毒者，四逆汤", "seg_from": 1438, "seg_to": 1440, "start_s": 8335.008, "end_s": 8366.638, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=8335s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 8335.01, "end_s": 8366.64}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "清毒=清谷", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0027", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "阳明发潮热而大便溏、渴、胸胁满不虚→小柴胡，非承气；承气须百分之百纯阳明。", "entity_ids": ["formula.xiao_chai_hu_tang", "formula.da_cheng_qi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c10", "evidence_quote": "胸险满而不虚者，这是小柴胡汤", "seg_from": 1492, "seg_to": 1493, "start_s": 8616.388, "end_s": 8635.893, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=8616s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 8616.39, "end_s": 8635.89}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "胸险=胸胁", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0028", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "treatment_principle", "statement": "大承气必过经乃可下：太阳少阳表证先解，纯阳明证具备后再攻，勿过急。", "entity_ids": ["formula.da_cheng_qi_tang", "six_channel.yangming"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c11", "evidence_quote": "我们出现大承气汤一定要过经乃可下什么叫过筋", "seg_from": 1572, "seg_to": 1578, "start_s": 9096.298, "end_s": 9167.893, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=9096s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 9096.3, "end_s": 9167.89}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "过筋=过经", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0029", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "呃逆无气、元气将脱，可用茯苓四逆汤加减；勿与可治之打嗝混。", "entity_ids": ["formula.fu_ling_si_ni_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c12", "evidence_quote": "这时候用茯苓四逆汤的加减", "seg_from": 1957, "seg_to": 1958, "start_s": 11181.03, "end_s": 11194.615, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=11181s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 11181.03, "end_s": 11194.61}, "confidence": 0.8, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0030", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "treatment_principle", "statement": "阳明有汗用桂枝汤（姜草枣护津），勿用麻黄；无汗而喘用麻黄汤先解表。有表证必先解表再攻里。", "entity_ids": ["formula.gui_zhi_tang", "formula.ma_huang_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c13", "evidence_quote": "只要有汗，你开桂枝汤，你即使开的很重，都不会丧失津液", "seg_from": 2075, "seg_to": 2093, "start_s": 11823.993, "end_s": 11936.268, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=11823s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 11823.99, "end_s": 11936.27}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0031", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "formula_composition", "statement": "茵陈蒿汤：茵陈与栀子等量，大黄减半；茵陈先煎去湿，栀子清上焦热，大黄利下焦湿热。", "entity_ids": ["formula.yin_chen_hao_tang", "herb.yin_chen_hao", "herb.zhi_zi"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c14", "evidence_quote": "我们的阴橙膏跟栀子呢是等量，比如说四钱四钱大黄两钱", "seg_from": 2160, "seg_to": 2167, "start_s": 12314.563, "end_s": 12377.673, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=12314s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 12314.56, "end_s": 12377.67}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "阴橙膏=茵陈蒿", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0032", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "抵当汤治下焦蓄血/瘀血（水蛭虻虫），为仲景活血化瘀第二主方；症见如狂、少腹硬满。轻证用桃核承气。", "entity_ids": ["formula.di_dang_tang", "formula.tao_he_cheng_qi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c14", "evidence_quote": "抵当就是绝对唯一处方没有第二个主方", "seg_from": 2207, "seg_to": 2266, "start_s": 12556.543, "end_s": 12865.575, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=12556s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 12556.54, "end_s": 12865.58}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0033", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "吴茱萸汤主胃虚寒朝食暮吐；宿食吐用大黄甘草汤。二者虚实不同。", "entity_ids": ["formula.wu_zhu_yu_tang", "formula.da_huang_gan_cao_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c15", "evidence_quote": "有果，是正虚症的时候无猪咀汤", "seg_from": 2388, "seg_to": 2389, "start_s": 13514.665, "end_s": 13538.35, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=13514s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 13514.67, "end_s": 13538.35}, "confidence": 0.8, "asr_note": "无猪咀=吴茱萸", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0034", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "五苓散：大便正常而小便不利口渴；表水热证/瘟疫利尿。猪苓汤：结石血淋小便痛。津伤甚者勿再利。", "entity_ids": ["formula.wu_ling_san", "formula.zhu_ling_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c15", "evidence_quote": "如果大便很正常，大便是正常小便不利，而渴才会用到五苓散", "seg_from": 2473, "seg_to": 2510, "start_s": 13980.632, "end_s": 14198.782, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=13980s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 13980.63, "end_s": 14198.78}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
