{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0036", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "formula_composition", "statement": "麻子仁丸：小承气（大黄厚朴枳实）加麻仁、芍药、杏仁润肠；老人气血虚便秘首选，缓下不伤正。", "entity_ids": ["formula.ma_zi_ren_wan", "formula.xiao_cheng_qi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c16", "evidence_quote": "小承气汤，再加上麻仁，芍药跟杏仁都是滋润的药", "seg_from": 2559, "seg_to": 2610, "start_s": 14459.612, "end_s": 14757.027, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=14459s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 14459.61, "end_s": 14757.03}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
