{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0040", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "treatment_principle", "statement": "大承气急下存阴：汗多则津伤快；十天不大便小便黄，不必再辨调胃/小承，径用大承气。", "entity_ids": ["formula.da_cheng_qi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c17", "evidence_quote": "十天不大便小变黄已经讲完了，你管他什么怎么调胃承气汤大小神器都不要去考虑大承气汤", "seg_from": 2705, "seg_to": 2721, "start_s": 15343.305, "end_s": 15456.99, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=15343s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 15343.31, "end_s": 15456.99}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0041", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "formula_composition", "statement": "栀子柏皮汤：栀子、炙甘草、黄柏；栀子清上焦热，黄柏清下焦热。可作眼科洗剂。", "entity_ids": ["formula.zhi_zi_bo_pi_tang", "herb.zhi_zi", "herb.huang_bai"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c18", "evidence_quote": "栀子薄汤汤呢它的处方哦，栀子好，中间是一个哦炙甘草，好再来是黄渤", "seg_from": 2861, "seg_to": 2864, "start_s": 16293.87, "end_s": 16324.66, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=16293s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 16293.87, "end_s": 16324.66}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "薄=柏；黄渤=黄柏", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-004.kp0042", "video_id": "shl-004", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "发黄三方：无汗有表→麻黄连轺赤小豆；有汗湿热在里→茵陈蒿；无表无里实仅瘀热→栀子柏皮。", "entity_ids": ["formula.ma_huang_lian_yao_chi_xiao_dou_tang", "formula.yin_chen_hao_tang", "formula.zhi_zi_bo_pi_tang"], "chapter_id": "shl-004.c18", "evidence_quote": "病人没有汗，完全不流汗，有表症的时候是麻黄连翘好，赤小豆", "seg_from": 2888, "seg_to": 2889, "start_s": 16462.86, "end_s": 16478.37, "citation": {"youtube_id": "nw-b_iqBXCg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nw-b_iqBXCg&t=16462s", "series": "shl", "episode": 4, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 4陽明症", "start_s": 16462.86, "end_s": 16478.37}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
